WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,110
I know now

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,110
Why did your father want this dog?

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,070
The training made me so cowardly

4
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:08,870
Feelings are about knowing how powerful he is, baby, okay?

5
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:16,780
Let’s move on to the next battle

6
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,580
He never lost a brother

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:25,260
It's too late for you to admit defeat now, why should I admit defeat?

8
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:26,940
I said I gave up

9
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,580
Rhubarb can't beat this cute guy

10
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,100
But two out of three games

11
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:34,520
I'd better win, brother Xinghuzi

12
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,440
I lost today and I am willing to admit defeat.

13
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,520
I'll give you a double share of the dog food tiger

14
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,720
Can you sell this dog?

15
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:43,770
I won't sell it for a thousand dollars

16
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:49,130
Rent your rhubarb for 200 yuan a day

17
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:55,450
This is not about money, right? Five hundred is enough to make a deal in one day and go out and have a drink.

18
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:56,690
I've prepared the mutton shabu-shabu

19
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,690
I have something to do with your rhubarb business.

20
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:03,630
Guarantee him to donate pre-dead rhubarb in advance

21
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:04,950
Just deal with it first

22
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:10,270
Let's go inside and drink some rhubarb. Don't blame me.

23
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,340
Sacrifice you

24
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:13,900
Happy old horse's family

25
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:16,730
It's not that I don't feel sorry for you

26
00:01:17,130 --> 00:01:19,010
It's because he gave too much
